#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:45
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:51
msgid "BTCPay Server URL"
msgstr "BTCPay Server URL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:131
msgid "Full URL to your BTCPay Server (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "Vollständige URL zu deinem BTCPay Server (HTTPS erforderlich)."

#. translators: 1: field label, e.g. "BTCPay API Key". 2: minimum length.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:138
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:387
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:72
msgid "BTCPay API Key"
msgstr "BTCPay API-Schlüssel"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:140
msgid "API key for BTCPay (min 20 characters)."
msgstr "API-Schlüssel für BTCPay (min. 20 Zeichen)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:146
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:388
msgid "BTCPay Store ID"
msgstr "BTCPay Store ID"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:148
msgid "Your BTCPay store identifier."
msgstr "Deine BTCPay-Shop-Kennung."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:153
msgid "BTCPay Lightning Payment Method ID (advanced)"
msgstr "BTCPay Lightning Payment Method ID (Fortgeschritten)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:155
msgid ""
"Only change this if your BTCPay Server version reports a different Lightning "
"payment method identifier than the default. Leave as \"BTC-LN\" unless "
"instructed otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Ändere dies nur, wenn deine BTCPay Server-Version eine andere Lightning-"
"Zahlungsmethoden-Kennung als die Standard meldet. Lasse es als \"BTC-LN\", "
"sofern nicht anders angegeben."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:162
msgid "BTCPay Connection Test"
msgstr "BTCPay-Verbindungstest"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:167
msgid "Webhook Configuration"
msgstr "Webhook-Konfiguration"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:169
msgid ""
"Automatic payment confirmation via webhooks (BTCPay push / lnd polling) "
"ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me Premium add-on. In the free version, "
"Lightning payments are confirmed manually — the settings below are a preview "
"and are not editable yet."
msgstr ""
"Die automatische Zahlungsbestätigung über Webhooks (BTCPay-Push / lnd-"
"Polling) kommt mit dem künftigen Premium-Add-on von PayCrypto.Me. In der "
"kostenlosen Version werden Lightning-Zahlungen manuell bestätigt — die "
"Einstellungen unten sind eine Vorschau und noch nicht bearbeitbar."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:172
msgid "BTCPay Webhook Secret"
msgstr "BTCPay Webhook Secret"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:174
msgid "Reserved for the Premium add-on. Not used by the free version."
msgstr ""
"Für das Premium-Add-on reserviert. Wird in der kostenlosen Version nicht "
"verwendet."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:175
msgid "Available in the Premium add-on"
msgstr "Im Premium-Add-on verfügbar"

#. translators: %s: field label, e.g. "BTCPay Server URL".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:183
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:382
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:70
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:106
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:112
msgid "lnd REST URL"
msgstr "lnd REST URL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:185
msgid "REST API endpoint (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "REST API-Endpunkt (HTTPS erforderlich)."

#. translators: 1: field label, e.g. "BTCPay API Key". 2: minimum length.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:192
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:383
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:125
msgid "lnd Macaroon (hex)"
msgstr "lnd Macaroon (hex)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:194
msgid "Admin macaroon in hexadecimal format (min 100 characters)."
msgstr "Admin Macaroon im Hexadezimalformat (min. 100 Zeichen)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:200
msgid "SSL Certificate (PEM)"
msgstr "SSL-Zertifikat (PEM)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:202
msgid ""
"Optional: Paste your SSL certificate in PEM format. If provided, this will "
"be used for verification instead of disabling SSL checks."
msgstr ""
"Optional: Füge dein SSL-Zertifikat im PEM-Format ein. Falls vorhanden, wird "
"dies zur Verifizierung anstelle der Deaktivierung von SSL-Prüfungen "
"verwendet."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:208
msgid "Verify SSL Certificate"
msgstr "SSL-Zertifikat verifizieren"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:210
msgid "Enable SSL certificate verification"
msgstr "SSL-Zertifikatverifizierung aktivieren"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:211
msgid ""
"Enable for production. If disabled and no certificate is provided, SSL "
"verification is skipped (development only)."
msgstr ""
"Für die Produktion aktivieren. Wenn deaktiviert und kein Zertifikat "
"bereitgestellt wird, wird die SSL-Verifizierung übersprungen (nur "
"Entwicklung)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:216
msgid "lnd REST Connection Test"
msgstr "lnd REST-Verbindungstest"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:283
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:319
msgid "🔌 Test connection"
msgstr "🔌 Verbindung testen"

#. translators: 1: settings field label, 2: selected Lightning node type.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:395
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is empty, and it is required for the selected node type (%2$s)."
msgstr "%1$s ist leer und für den gewählten Node-Typ (%2$s) erforderlich."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:35
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:349
msgid "On-Chain"
msgstr "On-Chain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:36
msgid "Accept Bitcoin payments Non-custodial via On-Chain"
msgstr "Akzeptiere Bitcoin-Zahlungen nicht verwahrbar über On-Chain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:39
msgid ""
"Use directly your Bitcoin wallet to pay. Place the order to view the QR code "
"and payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Verwende direkt deine Bitcoin-Geldbörse, um zu zahlen. Bestelle jetzt, um "
"den QR-Code und die Zahlungsanweisungen zu sehen."

#. translators: 1: list of missing PHP extensions, e.g. "GMP". 2: bech32 address prefix, e.g. "bc1".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:75
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This server is missing the PHP %1$s extension, which is required to derive "
"addresses from an xPub. Ask your host to enable it, or configure a single "
"fixed address starting with %2$s instead. Lightning payments are unaffected."
msgstr "Auf diesem Server fehlt die PHP-Erweiterung %1$s, die zum Ableiten von Adressen aus einem xPub benötigt wird. Bitte den Hoster, sie zu aktivieren, oder hinterlege stattdessen eine einzelne feste Adresse, die mit %2$s beginnt. Lightning-Zahlungen sind nicht betroffen."


#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:82
msgid "No network is selected in the gateway settings."
msgstr "In den Zahlungsart-Einstellungen ist kein Netzwerk ausgewählt."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:86
msgid ""
"No wallet xPub or Bitcoin address is configured in the gateway settings."
msgstr ""
"In den Zahlungsart-Einstellungen ist kein Wallet-xPub und keine Bitcoin-"
"Adresse hinterlegt."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:128
msgid "This server cannot derive addresses from an extended public key."
msgstr "Dieser Server kann keine Adressen aus einem erweiterten öffentlichen Schlüssel ableiten."


#. translators: 1: list of missing PHP extensions, e.g. "GMP". 2: bech32 address prefix, e.g. "bc1".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:131
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The PHP %1$s extension is not installed, so an xPub/yPub/zPub cannot be used "
"here — ask your host to enable it. You can still accept on-chain payments "
"right now by entering a single fixed address starting with %2$s in the field "
"below; every order is then paid to that same address, which is worse for "
"privacy but works without the extension. Lightning payments are unaffected."
msgstr "Die PHP-Erweiterung %1$s ist nicht installiert, daher kann hier kein xPub/yPub/zPub verwendet werden — bitte den Hoster, sie zu aktivieren. Du kannst On-Chain-Zahlungen trotzdem sofort annehmen, indem du im Feld unten eine einzelne feste Adresse einträgst, die mit %2$s beginnt; dann werden alle Bestellungen an dieselbe Adresse bezahlt, was schlechter für die Privatsphäre ist, aber ohne die Erweiterung funktioniert. Lightning-Zahlungen sind nicht betroffen."


#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:154
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:128
msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "Berechtigung verweigert."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:163
msgid "Reset failed. Check WooCommerce logs for details."
msgstr ""
"Zurücksetzen fehlgeschlagen. Überprüfe WooCommerce-Protokolle für Details."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:169
msgid "Reset request received."
msgstr "Zurücksetzen-Anfrage empfangen."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:177
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:182
msgid "Security check failed"
msgstr "Sicherheitsprüfung fehlgeschlagen"

#. translators: %s is the field label being validated, e.g. "Wallet xPub".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:194
#, php-format
msgid "Please enter a valid %s."
msgstr "Bitte gebe einen gültigen %s ein."

#. translators: %s: the underlying error message.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:217
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The wallet key could not be validated because of an internal error: %s. "
"Nothing was saved. This is not a problem with the key you entered."
msgstr ""
"Der Wallet-Schlüssel konnte wegen eines internen Fehlers nicht geprüft "
"werden: %s. Es wurde nichts gespeichert. Das Problem liegt nicht an dem "
"eingegebenen Schlüssel."

#. translators: 1: network the key actually belongs to, 2: network selected in settings.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:226
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This key belongs to %1$s, but the selected network is %2$s. Please provide a "
"key for the selected network."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Schlüssel gehört zu %1$s, das ausgewählte Netzwerk ist jedoch %2$s. "
"Bitte geben Sie einen Schlüssel für das ausgewählte Netzwerk an."

#. translators: %s is the field label being validated, e.g. "Wallet xPub".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:232
#, php-format
msgid "The %s provided is not valid for the selected network."
msgstr "Das bereitgestellte %s ist nicht gültig für das ausgewählte Netzwerk."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:249
msgid "Wallet xPub"
msgstr "Wallet xPub"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:258
msgid "Testnet Wallet xPub"
msgstr "Testnet Wallet xPub"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:273
msgid "Network Identifier"
msgstr "Netzwerk-Kennung"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:277
msgid ""
"Tip: It is always preferable to use the wallet xPub rather than a wallet "
"address for Bitcoin payments."
msgstr ""
"Tipp: Es ist immer besser, das Wallet xPub anstelle einer Wallet-Adresse für "
"Bitcoin-Zahlungen zu verwenden."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:281
msgid "Payment Timeout (hours)"
msgstr "Zahlungs-Timeout (Stunden)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:283
msgid ""
"Automatic order expiry after the timeout ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Premium add-on. In the free version, on-chain addresses stay valid until "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"Der automatische Ablauf der Bestellung nach dem Zeitlimit kommt mit dem "
"künftigen Premium-Add-on von PayCrypto.Me. In der kostenlosen Version "
"bleiben On-Chain-Adressen bis zur Zahlung gültig."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:289
msgid "Payment number of confirmations"
msgstr "Zahlungsbestätigungen"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:291
msgid ""
"Automatic on-chain confirmation tracking ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Premium add-on. In the free version, payments are verified manually."
msgstr ""
"Die automatische Verfolgung von On-Chain-Bestätigungen kommt mit dem "
"künftigen Premium-Add-on von PayCrypto.Me. In der kostenlosen Version werden "
"Zahlungen manuell überprüft."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:298
msgid "Danger Area"
msgstr "Gefahrenbereich"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:301
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Warnung:"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:301
msgid ""
"Resetting the payment derivation index will lead to the reuse of addresses "
"and loss of past data. Proceed with caution and ensure you understand the "
"implications."
msgstr ""
"Das Zurücksetzen des Zahlungsableitungsindex führt zu einer Wiederverwendung "
"von Adressen und zum Verlust von Daten. Seien Sie vorsichtig und stellen Sie "
